1. gitbook-cli/
   A modified fork of GitbookIO/gitbook-cli
   (https://github.com/GitbookIO/gitbook-cli), originally
   Copyright (c) FriendCode, Inc., declared by its package.json to be
   licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

   The fork is maintained here and has been modified substantially: the
   bundled programmatic npm was removed in favour of spawning the system
   npm, argument parsing moved from optimist to minimist, vulnerable
   dependencies were replaced, compatibility patches are now applied to
   installed engines, and tests were added. The changes are recorded in
   gitbook-cli/README.md and in this project's release notes.

2. GitBook engine
   The published Docker image bundles the GitBook engine (gitbook 3.2.3,
   https://github.com/GitbookIO/gitbook), Copyright (c) FriendCode, Inc.,
   licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its license text ships
   with the engine inside the image. Individual packages in its dependency
   tree are replaced with patched upstream releases at build time; see
   scripts/patch-vulnerable-deps.sh. Those packages remain under their own
   respective licenses.

